{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國軍情五處（MI5）首長麥卡勒姆（Ken McCallum）周二（13日）發表年度威脅評估演說，警告人工智能（AI）可能助恐怖分子製造生化武器。</p><p>該處今年成立AI威脅評估中心，應對新風險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.775953+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:35:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723758+00:00","content_hash":"ce9dc415f2787ead9ea5bb2263bf0b094fe5eb554a46607753d1d4b770ea241e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}